  ☑ Reconcile the current ownership/knowledge documentation, task traceability and retained limitations.
    Perform second review and independent completion audit of this unit; keep 8h's obligations unchecked.
  ☑ Completion: routine ownership events preserve valid knowledge, redundant purge APIs/callers are gone,
