    disk access, GPU work and CPU readback. Phase 9 qualification and user acceptance remain separate.
  Scope: VanillaGraphicsExpanded.Tests and its required fixtures/callers. Other test projects, including
    shader-build-tool tests, are excluded. Necessary shared declarations or production filesystem seams
    must be identified and justified individually; this is not authorization for unrelated redesign.
